{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainability-science","title":"可持续发展科学","stage":"DONE","category":"environmental-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"可持续发展科学-简介\">可持续发展科学 简介</h1><p>可持续发展科学是一门以问题为导向的交叉学科，研究如何在满足当代人需求的同时不损害后代人满足自身需求的能力。从1987年布伦特兰报告首次系统提出可持续发展概念，到2015年联合国通过17项可持续发展目标（SDGs），再到循环经济和ESG投资的全球兴起，可持续发展已从理念倡导演进为具有明确指标体系和实施路径的行动框架。</p>\n<p>本模块面向关注可持续发展实践的跨学科学习者，特别适合从事企业战略、投资分析、供应链管理和公共政策的从业者。通过系统学习可持续发展的理论框架、循环经济的设计原则和ESG的评估方法，读者能够理解行星边界对经济活动的约束，评估企业的可持续发展绩效，设计符合循环经济原则的商业模式，并在专业工作中整合环境、社会和治理维度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[可持续发展科学] --&gt; B[可持续发展]&#10;    A --&gt; C[循环经济]&#10;    A --&gt; D[ESG 与企业责任]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[SDG 框架]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[行星边界]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[可持续性指标]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[循环设计]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[废弃物层级]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[产业共生]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[ESG 框架]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[碳核算]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[绿色供应链]\">graph TD\n    A[可持续发展科学] --&gt; B[可持续发展]\n    A --&gt; C[循环经济]\n    A --&gt; D[ESG 与企业责任]\n    B --&gt; B1[SDG 框架]\n    B --&gt; B2[行星边界]\n    B --&gt; B3[可持续性指标]\n    C --&gt; C1[循环设计]\n    C --&gt; C2[废弃物层级]\n    C --&gt; C3[产业共生]\n    D --&gt; D1[ESG 框架]\n    D --&gt; D2[碳核算]\n    D --&gt; D3[绿色供应链]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>适用读者</td>\n<td>企业战略规划者、ESG 分析师、供应链管理者、公共政策研究者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前置知识</td>\n<td>基本经济学常识、企业管理基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心能力</td>\n<td>SDG 对标分析、循环经济设计、ESG 绩效评估、碳排放核算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用场景</td>\n<td>企业可持续发展报告编制、ESG 投资决策、循环商业模式设计、绿色采购策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习时长</td>\n<td>建议 20-30 小时系统学习</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第1章<strong>可持续发展</strong>建立理解可持续发展的理论基础。从联合国17项可持续发展目标的框架设计与指标体系出发，介绍行星边界理论——九大地球系统过程的安全运行空间，以及如何运用可持续性指标（生态足迹、物质流分析、人类发展指数）衡量一个国家或地区的可持续发展水平。这一章为后续的实践导向学习提供概念锚点。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>循环经济</strong>从线性经济模式（取用-制造-丢弃）的困境出发，介绍循环经济的设计原则——从设计阶段就考虑产品的再利用、再制造和再循环，深入废弃物层级理论——减量、再利用、回收、能量回收和填埋的优先序列，以及产业共生——企业间如何通过废弃物交换和能量梯级利用实现系统层面的资源效率提升。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>ESG与企业责任</strong>将可持续发展理念落地到企业运营层面。从主流ESG评估框架（GRI、SASB、TCFD）的比较与应用出发，介绍碳核算的方法学——范围一、范围二和范围三排放的界定与计算，以及绿色供应链管理——如何在采购、生产、物流和废弃物处理的全生命周期中整合环境绩效标准。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：先通过第1章建立可持续发展的宏观认知框架，再通过第2章掌握循环经济的设计方法论，最后在第3章中学习如何在企业层面落地实施可持续发展战略。从全球目标到设计原则再到企业实践，三章构成从理念到行动的完整路径。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sustainable-development","title":"可持续发展","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/sustainable-development","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sdg-framework","title":"可持续发展目标框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/sustainable-development/sdg-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"planetary-boundaries","title":"行星边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/sustainable-development/planetary-boundaries"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainability-indicators","title":"可持续发展指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/sustainable-development/sustainability-indicators"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"circular-economy","title":"循环经济","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/circular-economy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"circular-design","title":"循环设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/circular-economy/circular-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"waste-hierarchy","title":"废弃物管理层级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/circular-economy/waste-hierarchy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"industrial-ecology","title":"工业生态学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/circular-economy/industrial-ecology"},{"seq":4,"slug":"waste-management","title":"废弃物管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/circular-economy/waste-management"},{"seq":5,"slug":"industrial-symbiosis","title":"工业共生与生态工业园","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/circular-economy/industrial-symbiosis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"esg-and-corporate","title":"ESG 与企业责任","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/esg-and-corporate","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"esg-frameworks","title":"ESG 框架与标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/esg-and-corporate/esg-frameworks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-accounting","title":"碳核算与碳足迹","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/esg-and-corporate/carbon-accounting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"green-supply-chain","title":"绿色供应链管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/esg-and-corporate/green-supply-chain"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"green-finance","title":"绿色金融","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/green-finance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"esg-framework","title":"ESG 评估框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/green-finance/esg-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-markets","title":"碳市场","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/green-finance/carbon-markets"},{"seq":3,"slug":"green-bonds","title":"绿色债券","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/sustainability-science/green-finance/green-bonds"}]}]}